      id: 'kr-curve', area: 'change', stmts: ['3.6.1'], tag: 'named',
      name: 'Kübler-Ross Change Curve (the foundation’s seven areas)', short: 'Kübler-Ross change curve', who: 'Elisabeth Kübler-Ross Foundation, adapting Kübler-Ross’s stages of grief from On Death and Dying (1969)', kind: 'set', unit: 'areas',
