      name: 'Appreciative inquiry 4-D cycle', short: 'Appreciative inquiry (4-D)', who: 'David Cooperrider (with Suresh Srivastva, Case Western Reserve, 1980s); Cooperrider & Diana Whitney, Appreciative Inquiry: A Positive Revolution in Change (2005)', kind: 'ordered', unit: 'phases',
